    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200601211/2006012110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012110060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "お疲れ様、プロデューサー\r\nすまない、待たせてしまったね",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601211/2006012110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、そんな\r\n俺が呼び出したようなものだし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "撮影、お疲れ様",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012110070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──フフ、ありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601211/2006012110070"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "駐車場、この先なんだ\r\n行こうか",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012110080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601211/2006012110080"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0117",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 600
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ごめんな\r\nバタバタさせちゃったりとかしなかったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012110090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "とんでもない",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200601211/2006012110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012110100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "まるで何かの物語のように\r\nタイミングはぴったりだったし──",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601211/2006012110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012110110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "何より、味気ない帰り道が華やぐんだ\r\n私にとってはありがたさしかない申し出だったよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601211/2006012110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012110120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "連絡をもらえたことも──\r\nこうして仕事終わりにアナタに会えたことも",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601211/2006012110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012110130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "この上ない幸運だ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601211/2006012110130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……！　前にも言ったけど、\r\nなんかすごいことを成し遂げたみたいになるな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012110140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "言い続けなければ、\r\nアナタはその自覚を持ってくれないようだからね",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601211/2006012110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012110150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタのおかげで間違いなく、\r\n私の心は潤っているんだよ？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601211/2006012110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あはは、そうか\r\nそれなら──ありがたく受け取っておこうかな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012110160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601211/2006012110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それで、俺からも贈るよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012110170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601211/2006012110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶の帰りに間に合って、ラッキーだった！\r\n──って気持ちをさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012110180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、本当かい？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601211/2006012110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう\r\n遅い時間は、極力ひとりになってほしくないし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012110190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "過保護な人だね",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601211/2006012110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012110200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そう思うよ？　遅いと言っても、\r\n塾や習い事なんかで出歩いている学生も多い時間帯だ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601211/2006012110200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……まぁ、確かに\r\nでも──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012110210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『でも』──",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601211/2006012110210",
    "autoWaitTime": 1300
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012110220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だからこそ、嬉しいな\r\nアナタの心を感じるようだ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601211/2006012110220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012110230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私を案じてくれる──\r\n仕事熱心なアナタの心をね？",
    "charAnim1": "wink",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601211/2006012110230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、うん\r\nそう受け取ってもらえてるなら、俺も嬉しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
